# T_SCRR: on NET the server hung up while the login screen was up, so
# the LOGIN finds the link lost.  The link is made again and HELLO sent
# again, naming the new call's NetBIOS name as the station, which the
# status line shows; the login screen says so and asks for the password
# again.
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T secret1
K ENTER
S RELINKED
T secret1
K ENTER
